---
// Side-by-side readability comparison. Each column receives a real,
// syntax-highlighted code block via a named slot from the MDX page.
---

<section class="compare">
	<header>
		<h2>The same config, easier to read</h2>
		<p>
			CCL drops the punctuation tax without giving up predictable parser behavior.
			Compare a small service config in CCL and JSON.
		</p>
	</header>

	<div class="cols">
		<div class="col">
			<span class="tag ccl">CCL</span>
			<slot name="ccl" />
		</div>
		<div class="col">
			<span class="tag json">JSON</span>
			<slot name="json" />
		</div>
	</div>

	<p class="proof">
		The syntax is backed by reference behavior, conformance levels, and a shared test suite:
		<a href="/behavior-reference/">check the behavior reference</a>,
		<a href="/reference/conformance-levels/">conformance levels</a>, or
		<a href="/test-suite-guide/">test-suite guide</a>.
	</p>
</section>

<style>
	.compare {
		padding: 5.5rem 0;
	}

	header h2 {
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		margin: 0;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	header p {
		margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
		font-size: var(--sl-text-lg);
		max-width: 52ch;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.cols {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin-top: 2.2rem;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50rem) {
		.cols {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	.col {
		position: relative;
	}

	.tag {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
		border-radius: 6px;
		margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
	}

	.tag.ccl {
		background: var(--sl-color-accent);
		color: var(--ccl-on-accent);
	}

	.tag.json {
		background: var(--sl-color-gray-5);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-1);
	}

	.col :global(.expressive-code) {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.proof {
		margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
		max-width: 68ch;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		line-height: 1.6;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.proof a {
		color: var(--ccl-contrast-high);
		font-weight: 600;
		text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
	}
</style>
